1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:07,520
A pending order waits and only trades when the price reaches your level.

2
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:10,480
Right click an instrument. There are Stop and Limit entry orders.

3
00:00:10,580 --> 00:00:15,290
A Limit Buy buys if the price falls to your level. Choose Entry Limit Buy.

4
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:18,650
The ticket opens on the Limit tab.

5
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:23,180
Set how far from today's price it should wait, in pips.

6
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:27,540
The rate updates to match: this is the price it will buy at.

7
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:33,380
Click Buy to place the order.

8
00:00:33,480 --> 00:00:37,310
It is waiting now, under Pending.

9
00:00:37,410 --> 00:00:41,810
It stays here until the price reaches it, or until you cancel it.

